      "execution": {
        "startingPosition": "Log the total bar plus plates. Stand with the bar secured in a two-hand front rack.",
        "movement": "Squat until the hip crease passes below the knees, then rise directly into the overhead press in one fluid motion without pausing at the front rack.",
        "endpoint": "Finish standing tall with both elbows fully straight and the bar overhead.",
        "returnPhase": "Lower the bar under control to the front rack and begin the next full squat without adding a jerk dip.",
        "controlledJoints": "Track the knees with the feet, brace the trunk, and keep the squat-to-press transition continuous.",
        "supportAndPosture": "Maintain a secure two-hand front-rack grip and keep the trunk braced through the continuous drive.",
